Candidates offered, nothing armed
description: the dropdown_open state
- >
  The dropdown hangs under the active cell - the context's real children as TOC rows (icons and
  all) followed by the operator hints, ranked by the typed prefix. NOTHING is highlighted (hi =
  -1): Enter here commits the typed query, never a hint; Tab takes the FIRST candidate
- !!<*yamlover: $defs: table>
  header:
    - Event
      width: 2
    - 'Condition / note'
      width: 4
    - 'Next state'
      width: 2
  - ['`alphanumeric`', '', '`dropdown_open` (stays)']
  - ['`down_arrow`', '', '[dropdown_armed](*::server:query-editor:dropdown_armed)']
  - ['`up_arrow`', '', '[dropdown_armed](*::server:query-editor:dropdown_armed)']
  - ['`hover_candidate`', '', '[dropdown_armed](*::server:query-editor:dropdown_armed)']
  - ['`click_candidate`', '', '[cell_editing](*::server:query-editor:cell_editing)']
  - ['`tab`', '', '[cell_editing](*::server:query-editor:cell_editing)']
  - ['`enter`', 'the filter answered with matches', '[filtered](*::server:query-editor:filtered)']
  - ['`enter`', 'the filter answered with none', '[nop](*::server:query-editor:nop)']
  - ['`enter`', 'the filter is in flight', '`dropdown_open` (stays)']
  - ['`escape`', '', '[cell_editing](*::server:query-editor:cell_editing)']
  - ['`toc_click`', 'a MATCH row', '[filtered](*::server:query-editor:filtered)']
  - ['`toc_click`', 'otherwise', '[idle_path](*::server:query-editor:idle_path)']
